# ── Source material — deliberately NOT committed ───────────────────────────
# Assets/ holds the ORIGINAL, UNBLURRED behind-the-scenes photographs. Faces of
# clients and crew are visible in them. Only the face-obscured, web-sized copies
# under public/portfolio/ are published — pushing the originals to a remote
# would undo that entirely, and would be irreversible once cloned or forked.
#
# It is also ~198MB of raw video (single files up to 69MB), which GitHub flags
# and which would make every clone painfully slow.
#
# Keep this directory backed up somewhere private; it is the master copy.
/Assets/

# Internal planning document, not part of the site.
X9_Creatives_Service_PRD_Detailed.docx
